  ],
  "notes": "The dressing recipe is only in the original caption, not in the video: it looks like thick (hung) curd with some spice and herbs, so use plain thick curd or add salt and pepper to taste. Oil, spice, vegetable and paneer amounts other than ginger are guesses (~). The rolling step is not shown, only the finished wrap."
